# Pictures used for testing. Not part of the plugin.
#
# Four pictures ship and stay tracked: charles-william-wyllie-the-backwater.jpg paints the ground behind
# every look, and the three Custom slots are born as designed presets that name
# their own file (the three Johan Christian Dahl paintings). Anything else in
# here is a picture for trying things out, and is not committed.
desktop/assets/*
!desktop/assets/charles-william-wyllie-the-backwater.jpg
!desktop/assets/johan-christian-dahl-the-watzmann.jpg
!desktop/assets/johan-christian-dahl-stalheim.jpg
!desktop/assets/johan-christian-dahl-view-of-dresden-by-moonlight.jpg

# Dev tooling. The two scripts are committed as an aid to whoever changes a
# preset palette or the look machinery; everything they generate is not, and
# neither is their one dependency.
dev/.work/
dev/node_modules/
dev/package-lock.json

# Local and agent files. Secrets and per-machine tool settings never belong in
# the repository; these are listed here rather than only in a local exclude so
# a fresh clone or a new worktree is covered too.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.claude/
